# Development Guidelines

- Always run the test suite before committing; do not commit with failing tests.
- Use the units and numerical conventions already present in the code — never
  silently reinterpret a rate/vol/price convention.
- Commit in small, reviewable steps. Never `git push`, merge, or force/reset —
  those are blocked by `.openhands/hooks.json` and require a human.

